plaso.tsv: what plaso's own User Access Logging parser (esedb/user_access_logging,
the log2timeline/plaso:20260720 Docker image) reads from the two test databases
(tests/fixtures/plaso/), its 42 events grouped back into one line per row:

- client: role, role name, account, address, total accesses, first and last
  access (FILETIME), tenant;
- role: role, role name, first and last seen;
- dns: address, host name, last seen;
- system: creation time, DNS host name, domain, build.

Written from plaso's json_line output (psort -o json_line), not from this crate.
